prompt:
This JavaScript function should return the words of a sentence in reverse order as a single string, but callers receive an array instead. Fix it.

```javascript
function reverseWords(sentence) {
  return sentence.split(" ").reverse();
}
```

expected_answer:
function reverseWords(sentence) {
  return sentence.split(" ").reverse().join(" ");
}

